{"ts":1792127532205,"speaker":"大智","text":"我是大智，正在旁听记录。需要时请呼叫大智；人与人讨论时我会轻量拉回议程。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127545094,"speaker":"会场","text":"大智听我说。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127554516,"speaker":"会场","text":"主题是什么？","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127562970,"speaker":"会场","text":"大智听我说。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127575860,"speaker":"会场","text":"老罗那份不放香菜，小赵还是多汤，知道。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127583082,"speaker":"会场","text":"老板，你家招牌还是石榴？一直石榴没涨也没降，给我们来两碗，正常做就行。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127587941,"speaker":"会场","text":"你家肉一直这么多。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127590014,"speaker":"会场","text":"一直这个量。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127601253,"speaker":"会场","text":"今天人多，可能慢两分钟，着急的话先跟你们说，没事，等两分钟，别挨两句骂。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127608499,"speaker":"会场","text":"大智。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127610909,"speaker":"会场","text":"总结下刚刚的对话。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127623752,"speaker":"会场","text":"大智。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127626290,"speaker":"会场","text":"总结一下刚刚的对话。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127631658,"speaker":"会场","text":"大智总结下刚刚的对话。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127675453,"speaker":"会场","text":"大智。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
{"ts":1792127691582,"speaker":"会场","text":"大智总结下，刚刚对话。","mode":"IDLE_LISTEN","segmentId":"seg_1792127530092"}
